sequenceDiagram
    participant C as ConsumerContext
    participant D as DLX API

    C->>D: GET /token/{value}<br/>X-DICOM-LINK-EXCHANGE header
    D-->>C: TFA Questions

    C->>D: POST /tokentfa/{value}<br/>TFA Answers
    D-->>C: JWT

    C->>D: GET /list<br/>Authorization: Bearer JWT
    D-->>C: Data Items

    C->>D: GET /download/{id}<br/>Authorization: Bearer JWT
    D-->>C: Binary Data

    C->>D: GET /downloadall<br/>Authorization: Bearer JWT
    D-->>C: ZIP (IHE PDI)
